  "content": "<div>\n\n# 🪙 英雄崛起：貨幣  \n### *一款以RPG為主題的Minecraft經濟模組*\n\n<br>\n\n**英雄崛起：貨幣** 新增了一套簡潔的**以太貨幣系統**，以及透過**NPC商人**進行交易的簡潔沉浸式方式——專為想要經濟與進程體驗，又不想過於繁雜的模組包而設計。\n\n<br>\n\n[![Discord](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fDiscord-Join%2bServer-5865F2%253fstyle%253dfor-the-badge%2526logo%253ddiscord%2526logoColor%253dwhite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join Server-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white</a>)](<a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zZUY7ejM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/c8zZUY7ejM</a>)\n[![Ko-fi](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fKo--fi-Support%2bMe-FF5E5B%253fstyle%253dfor-the-badge%2526logo%253dkofi%2526logoColor%253dwhite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-Support Me-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white</a>)](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnoahjenhoko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/noahjenhoko</a>)\n\n</div><div>\n\n  \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fjenoko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rG2pqfq3/banner.png\" alt=\"KCB Hosting 橫幅\">\n  </a>\n\n  \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fjenoko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MyRPwLxL/banner2.png\" alt=\"KCB Hosting 橫幅 2\">\n  </a>\n\n</div><p>\n  🚀 需要可靠的遊戲/伺服器託管服務嗎？看看<strong>KCB Hosting</strong>！<br>\n  點擊下方連結獲取<strong>專屬折扣碼</strong> 👇<br>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fjenoko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    https://kcbhosting.com/aff/jenoko\n  </a>\n</p><hr><h2>✨ 核心功能</h2><h3>💠 以太貨幣</h3><ul>\n<li>新增專用貨幣（<strong>以太</strong>），專為長期進程與穩定物價設計。</li>\n<li>以太會清晰顯示在HUD上，方便您在遊戲中快速查看。</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>🧑‍🍳 NPC商人</h3><ul>\n<li>與專業的商店NPC交易：<strong>鐵匠</strong>、<strong>廚師</strong>、<strong>煉金術師</strong>、<strong>草藥師</strong></li>\n<li>每位商人提供符合RPG世界風格的主題交易列表。</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Kxxz1T34/Screenshot-2026-01-01-at-17-53-41.png\" width=\"48%\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TxwMSPPy/Screenshot-2026-01-01-at-17-54-02.png\" width=\"48%\">\n\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jPHL5hXV/Screenshot-2026-01-01-at-17-54-30.png\" width=\"48%\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jPywVmMr/Screenshot-2026-01-01-at-17-54-56.png\" width=\"48%\">\n\n</div><hr><h3>🧾 現代RPG交易介面</h3><ul>\n<li>簡潔、極簡的介面，兼具<strong>Minecraft原生感</strong>與<strong>RPG風格</strong></li>\n<li>流暢瀏覽，搭配緊湊的物品展示與分類式交易選項</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/m5xD4V8b/Screenshot-2026-01-01-at-17-55-06.png\" width=\"48%\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WNZMsdBV/Screenshot-2026-01-01-at-17-55-11.png\" width=\"48%\">\n\n</div><h2>⚠️ 重要提示（原版合成變更）</h2><ul>\n<li>安裝此模組後，<strong>原版武器與護甲的合成配方將被停用</strong>。</li>\n<li>遊戲進程旨在透過<strong>賺取以太</strong>並<strong>透過NPC商人購買裝備</strong>來進行，而非合成標準的原版裝備。</li>\n</ul><h2>🎯 遊戲理念</h2><p>此模組旨在讓交易成為世界的一部分——<strong>簡單、清晰且回饋感強</strong>——同時不讓玩家感到負擔。<br>\n非常適合想要<strong>經濟層面</strong>、<strong>NPC商店</strong>以及精美介面體驗的<strong>模組包</strong>。</p><div>\n\n## 🔗 社群與支援\n\n- **[➡️ 加入Discord](<a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zZUY7ejM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/c8zZUY7ejM</a>)**\n- **[☕ 在Ko-fi上贊助](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnoahjenhoko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/noahjenhoko</a>)**\n\n\n</div>",
